  nonce: 2af1  # 2af1
  message: "P4 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 9ae4abe13f; owner-requested re-check of open P4 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p4_review_11012026/links1/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Re-checked 2026-11-01 at 9ae4abe13f. The method-vs-function half is fixed: WI-barip (974edbe14d, 2026-10-19) keys methods by qualified name. In a fixture with def index plus Admin.index, path(\"\", index) resolves to the function. Nested classes are still keyed by bare name (py.py ~3566). A top-level LoginView followed by Outer.LoginView, with path(\"login/\", LoginView.as_view()), gives a UsageContext symbol_ref pointing at the nested class (urls.py:19-20). The dispatches_to edge pointed at the correct class (9-10). Volume is still unmeasured. MECHANISM: py.py registers nested ClassDefs in the flat symbol_by_name under their bare name (methods became qualified via WI-barip), and route/view resolution reads that table by bare name."  # 2af1
